sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Officer as Operator / Officer
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Storage as StorageManager
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Worker as ThreadPool Vision Worker
    participant YOLO as YOLOv8 Tracking Engine
    participant YuNet as YuNet Face Detector
    participant Quality as Quality Scoring Engine

    Officer->>API: POST /api/upload-and-process (multipart/form-data)
    API->>Storage: Stream chunked write to disk (enforce MAX_SIZE)
    API->>Storage: Compute SHA-256 hash of raw video
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO videos (status='queued', sha256=...)
    API-->>Officer: 202 Accepted {task_id, status: 'processing'}

    API->>Worker: Dispatch background video task
    Worker->>DB: UPDATE videos SET processing_status='processing'

    loop For each frame in video
        Worker->>YOLO: Detect and track person bounding boxes (ByteTrack)
        Worker->>YuNet: Detect faces within person bounding boxes
        Worker->>Quality: Compute Laplacian sharpness, exposure, contrast
        Quality-->>Worker: Quality score & grade (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/POOR)
    end

    Worker->>DB: INSERT INTO person_tracks (start_frame, end_frame, ...)
    Worker->>DB: INSERT INTO face_evidence (quality_score, crop_hash, ...)
    Worker->>DB: SELECT FOR UPDATE track row & atomically promote best-evidence
    Worker->>DB: UPDATE videos SET processing_status='completed', duration=..., fps=...

    loop Polling interval
        Officer->>API: GET /api/tasks/{task_id}/status
        API-->>Officer: {status: 'completed', progress: 100.0, results: ...}
    end

    Officer->>API: GET /api/v1/evidence/best
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM face_evidence WHERE is_best=true
    DB-->>API: Best face evidence list
    API-->>Officer: 200 OK [Best forensic candidates]
